<node id="&quot;RISK CATEGORIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Risk categories are frameworks used to evaluate the potential dangers associated with AI models, particularly focusing on cybersecurity, persuasion, and CBRN, which are crucial for determining safe deployment and development."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-110a9d0daa1bc9fd14dbe5e0d3884ec7</data>
