</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTENTIAL RISK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Existential risk refers to the theoretical danger posed by artificial intelligence, such as the potential of AI to become uncontrollable and cause human extinction, a significant concern in AI safety discourse."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-110a9d0daa1bc9fd14dbe5e0d3884ec7</data>
</node>
