  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jon Porter is the author of the article discussing Ofcom's guidelines on the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"UK is the country implementing new rules for the internet and the subject of the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ONLINE SAFETY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Online Safety Act is legislation being discussed and implemented to address online harms, including AI-generated content."&lt;SEP&gt;"Online Safety Act is the legislation that Ofcom's guidelines are designed to help comply with, aiming to address illegal content on tech platforms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9519d510542618139ea10a3404f5ee70</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TECH FIRMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tech firms are the entities that will need to follow Ofcom's guidelines to comply with the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ILLEGAL CONTENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Illegal content refers to various inappropriate or unlawful material that platforms like social media and search engines must address, as per the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILD SEXUAL ABUSE MATERIAL (CSAM)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Child sexual abuse material is specifically mentioned as illegal content that platforms must address under the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERRORISM CONTENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Terrorism content is also identified as an illegal content that must be managed by platforms under the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORNOGRAPHY SITES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pornography sites are categorized as entities that must comply with the Online Safety Act regarding the management of illegal content."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;X (FORMERLY TWITTER)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"X, previously known as Twitter, is noted as an outlier in the context of the Online Safety Act and its implications for encryption and moderation standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGULATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulator refers to the body like Ofcom that creates and enforces rules for entities within a specific domain, in this case, online platforms and tech companies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DUTY OF CARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Duty of Care is a principle requiring tech firms to be proactive and responsible for user safety, as emphasized in the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TECH COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tech companies are the entities that will be regulated and must adapt their practices to comply with the Online Safety Act."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTENT MODERATION TEAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Content Moderation Teams are groups within tech firms that handle the review and management of content to ensure compliance with legal and ethical standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENCRYPTED SERVICES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Encrypted Services, such as WhatsApp, are mentioned in the context of the challenge they face in implementing accredited technology for CSAM detection without breaking encryption, highlighting a technological and legal challenge.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEEPFAKES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deepfakes refer to AI-generated content that can be used for fraud, which falls under the scope of the Online Safety Act due to its potential harmful use."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c611e26c21bdff7da7b97bde803980c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AI-GENERATED CONTENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AI-Generated Content represents any content created via artificial intelligence that may be regulated under the Online Safety Act if it's used for harmful purposes, such as generating child sexual abuse material or deepfakes for fraud."</data>
