  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTOMATION-FRIENDLY INDUSTRIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Automation-friendly industries such as manufacturing and logistics are highlighted as areas with significant potential for the next wave of robotics deployment due to high demand and labor shortages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION AND HEALTHCARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Construction and healthcare are identified as potential sectors for the next phase of robotics advancements, given the gap between current workforce capabilities and the demand for skilled labor.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GENERAL-PURPOSE ROBOTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"General-Purpose Robots represent the idealized goal of robots that can operate across a wide range of unstructured environments and tasks, an objective that is still facing considerable challenges to achieve.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUST AND USER DELIGHT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Trust and User Delight are crucial factors in the development of robots, as they need to be reliable and user-friendly to achieve widespread adoption and be considered general-purpose.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPETITIVE LABOR MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY TREND"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Competitive Labor Market describes the tension between the demand for skilled labor and the supply in critical sectors like construction and healthcare, which positions them as potential targets for robotics innovation.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTIFUNCTIONAL IN-HOME ROBOTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The topic of multifunctional in-home robots, beyond simple vacuum cleaners, is addressed, indicating the future potential for broader home robot integration and consumer acceptance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ROBOTICS ADOPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TREND"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Robotics Adoption is discussed as a gradual process across various industries, starting from manufacturing and logistics, and potentially moving towards construction and healthcare, with an eye towards achieving mass consumer market penetration.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cf83ecaf7a04a7fc3a82dd12e0a43fb5</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INNOVATIVE COMPANIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
