  <data key="d2">chunk-84c6e6566cf973ee85bc9c96af876766</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SMALL BUSINESSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Small Businesses are entities that are part of the innovative companies, characterized by their size and need to rely on larger organizations for certain advantages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84c6e6566cf973ee85bc9c96af876766</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADVANTAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advantages refer to the benefits or positive outcomes that small innovative companies gain by standing on the backs of giants, such as access to resources, expertise, and market reach."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-84c6e6566cf973ee85bc9c96af876766</data>
</node>
