</node>
<node id="&quot;SHAYDA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Shayda is a dramatisation of Noora Niasari's early life and portrays the struggles and triumphs of an Iranian immigrant named Shayda."&lt;SEP&gt;"Shayda is an individual Iranian woman who has left Iran, embodying the spirit of resistance and sacrifice."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aaba30aa4656afc2913dd441e62ee04</data>
</node>
