</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal process is a critical element in Shayda's story, reflecting the bureaucratic and justice system challenges she faces in fighting for custody."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CUSTODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Custody represents a legal battle and a central issue in Shayda's life, highlighting the struggles immigrant women may face in such situations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSIAN NEW YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CULTURAL EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Persian New Year rituals are part of Shayda's cultural identity, offering a sense of continuity and hope amidst the challenges she faces.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MUSIC AND POETRY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CULTURAL ASPECT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Music and poetry are integral to Shayda's cultural connections and her personal growth, symbolizing the beauty and resilience of her heritage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADULT MEN'S TALES&quot;">
