  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"International awareness is the concept of the global recognition of issues, which Niasari hopes will come as a result of the women's resistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"International awareness refers to the global response and recognition of Iranian women's struggles, which Noora Niasari hopes will lead to more diverse stories being told and heard."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5599c582309361a5c5d359f5f068cc3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aaba30aa4656afc2913dd441e62ee04</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THE WORLD&quot;">
